   "type": "table",
   "title": "Devices",
   "description": "The selected devices, busiest first by download over the time range. `NOT LISTED` = MAC isn't in `/etc/dnsmasq.d/hosts.conf`; its name comes from the DHCP lease hostname, the vendor, or the raw MAC.",
